gp-arcade-input 0
# The first MAME oracle capture of Tapper: power-on, 30 seconds of attract
# mode with nothing pressed, a coin, start 1, then a few seconds of play
# with moves and taps. 30 frames a second.
system rbtapper
columns CSRLDUT
# power-on and attract mode, frames 1 to 900
900 .......
# a coin
6 C......
54 .......
# start 1
6 .S.....
234 .......
